{"4317870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pemkie Island", "steam_appid": 4317870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to Pemkie Island!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/102cb578e499d5eb7bc87bab13fe157e.poster.avif?t=1786440099\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/102cb578e499d5eb7bc87bab13fe157e.webm?t=1786440099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/102cb578e499d5eb7bc87bab13fe157e.mp4?t=1786440099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a <strong>roguelite monster-collector RPG</strong> packed with tons of different <strong>Pemkies to catch</strong>!<br><strong>Tame</strong> the ultimate team of <strong>Pemkies</strong>, build a powerful <strong>Skill </strong>collection, and <strong>journey</strong> across <strong>five distinct regions</strong> on <strong>Pemkie Island</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run offers a fresh chance to <strong>craft the perfect combination</strong> and <strong>restore balance to the world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/afda6cfd55eff0f25bcbf51bbb12803a.poster.avif?t=1786440099\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/afda6cfd55eff0f25bcbf51bbb12803a.webm?t=1786440099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/afda6cfd55eff0f25bcbf51bbb12803a.mp4?t=1786440099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island used to be a peaceful paradise where humans and Pemkies lived in perfect harmony, until.. <strong>something unknown changed everything</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sudden, destructive surge in the island's core energy shattered the balance, distorting reality and corrupting the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you wash ashore: <strong>no memory, no past, just a strange and inexplicable connection to this world</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the island's ancient history, uncover your place in it all, and find out what it truly takes to restore the balance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/b5633e6c4f448c17795334b115825a75.poster.avif?t=1786440099\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/b5633e6c4f448c17795334b115825a75.webm?t=1786440099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/b5633e6c4f448c17795334b115825a75.mp4?t=1786440099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical 6v6 Combat:</strong> Engage in deep, turn-based battles. Position your Pemkies to exploit enemy weaknesses and break through their defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draft &amp; Build:</strong> Defeat opponents and draft a new Skill directly from their set! Build a powerful deck out of whatever fate hands you to survive the run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Roguelite Runs:</strong> The island shows no mercy. If you run out of energy, you are sent right back to the start.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/3da3b22fef8fc38e0b0270baa29836c7.poster.avif?t=1786440099\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/3da3b22fef8fc38e0b0270baa29836c7.webm?t=1786440099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/3da3b22fef8fc38e0b0270baa29836c7.mp4?t=1786440099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90 unique creatures</strong>: Discover, catch, and tame every Pemkie hiding across the island's ever-changing landscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engineer Your Perfect Team:</strong> Every Pemkie is born with a unique Trait. Find Energy Wells to perform <strong>Evofusion</strong>, combining two creatures so the newly fused friend inherits the Traits of both ancestors. Don't just catch a team, engineer it!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friends &amp; Loot:</strong> Meet quirky NPCs along the way, complete their quests, and earn sweet loot to help you on your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to Pemkie Island!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/102cb578e499d5eb7bc87bab13fe157e.poster.avif?t=1786440099\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/102cb578e499d5eb7bc87bab13fe157e.webm?t=1786440099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/102cb578e499d5eb7bc87bab13fe157e.mp4?t=1786440099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a <strong>roguelite monster-collector RPG</strong> packed with tons of different <strong>Pemkies to catch</strong>!<br><strong>Tame</strong> the ultimate team of <strong>Pemkies</strong>, build a powerful <strong>Skill </strong>collection, and <strong>journey</strong> across <strong>five distinct regions</strong> on <strong>Pemkie Island</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run offers a fresh chance to <strong>craft the perfect combination</strong> and <strong>restore balance to the world</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/afda6cfd55eff0f25bcbf51bbb12803a.poster.avif?t=1786440099\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/afda6cfd55eff0f25bcbf51bbb12803a.webm?t=1786440099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/afda6cfd55eff0f25bcbf51bbb12803a.mp4?t=1786440099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island used to be a peaceful paradise where humans and Pemkies lived in perfect harmony, until.. <strong>something unknown changed everything</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sudden, destructive surge in the island's core energy shattered the balance, distorting reality and corrupting the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you wash ashore: <strong>no memory, no past, just a strange and inexplicable connection to this world</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the island's ancient history, uncover your place in it all, and find out what it truly takes to restore the balance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/b5633e6c4f448c17795334b115825a75.poster.avif?t=1786440099\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/b5633e6c4f448c17795334b115825a75.webm?t=1786440099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/b5633e6c4f448c17795334b115825a75.mp4?t=1786440099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical 6v6 Combat:</strong> Engage in deep, turn-based battles. Position your Pemkies to exploit enemy weaknesses and break through their defenses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draft &amp; Build:</strong> Defeat opponents and draft a new Skill directly from their set! Build a powerful deck out of whatever fate hands you to survive the run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Roguelite Runs:</strong> The island shows no mercy. If you run out of energy, you are sent right back to the start.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/3da3b22fef8fc38e0b0270baa29836c7.poster.avif?t=1786440099\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/3da3b22fef8fc38e0b0270baa29836c7.webm?t=1786440099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/extras/3da3b22fef8fc38e0b0270baa29836c7.mp4?t=1786440099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90 unique creatures</strong>: Discover, catch, and tame every Pemkie hiding across the island's ever-changing landscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engineer Your Perfect Team:</strong> Every Pemkie is born with a unique Trait. Find Energy Wells to perform <strong>Evofusion</strong>, combining two creatures so the newly fused friend inherits the Traits of both ancestors. Don't just catch a team, engineer it!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Friends &amp; Loot:</strong> Meet quirky NPCs along the way, complete their quests, and earn sweet loot to help you on your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "short_description": "Pemkie Island is a monster taming RPG adventure, in a roguelite format. Travel across the 5 different regions while discovering and taming unique creatures called Pemkies. Master their traits, choose the right skills and build the best team possible to restore balance!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/287cbab10163ba42a46a56aef36b65035960631e/header.jpg?t=1786440099", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4317870/09e3686